    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278439</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>みそを渡しますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Give them a Miso?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>来ただす来ただす。
魅惑のありじごくこーなーに
また呼ばれて来ただす！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yew came! Yew came!
Yew've been called by
the alluring Antlion Corner!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魅惑って言うか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alluring, huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だーいじょぶ
だーいじょぶ。
ぜーんぶわかってるから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's okay, it's okay. I
understand everything.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人の話聞いてないシ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They don't listen very
well, do they...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今回、こちらにぶち込んで……、
じゃなくて、ありじごく様に、
交換をお願いする品物は……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This time, we'll be tossing in...
err, I mean, the Great Antlion
Pit will exchange for us...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ざざーん！
みそですね、みそ
食材の『みそ』ざんす～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ta-dah! It's miso! You
know, miso! The cooking
ingredient, "miso"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>みそくれよ、みそ！
の、みそだすね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We need miso! Miso!
That kind of miso,
yew know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃ、やっとくか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, let's go for it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だべよ？　だべか？
そうだべか？？？
ごって、わくわく～～～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it? Isn't it? It is, isn't it?
Aaalrighty, so exciting~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>みそを
ありじごくの中に捨てるって
随分シュールな絵だーよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Throwing miso away into
an antlion pit's a pretty
surreal image, ain't it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>捨ててるんじゃなくて
ありじごく様に
渡してるんだってばよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're not throwing it
away. We're giving it
to the Great Antlion Pit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほなら、いくだすよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Weeelllll then, let's go!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マジで？　ジーマー？
本気の本気で？？？
ガス、ガスガス、ガス！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really? For realsies?
Truthfully truly?? Vroom,
vroom vroom, vroom!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はいよー、来たよー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoop, here it is!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さーさー、
今回のお宝はなんだすか～？？
なんだろうだすか～～～？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lessee, what treasure
will it be this time~?
What'll it beee~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だかだかだかだかだか～
ざざ～～～～ん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dundundundun
dun~ Ta-dah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今回はじゃがいもでした！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This time, it's a potato!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんで、みそが
じゃがいもに変わるんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why did miso turn
into a potato...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでだすかなぁ？
ありじごく様の
お考えだすからなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, why indeed? I guess
the Great Antlion Pit
thought it up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれじゃない？
みそを砂の上に落とすと、
じゃがいもっぽく見えるとか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, maybe it's that? If you
drop miso on top of sand,
doesn't it look like a potato?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それ、本気で
言ってるのかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have to wonder, do you
seriously mean that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなもん、
うちらだって
知るもんかよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, let's be real. What makes
you think we give a damn?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クリュウ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Coulleeuuu...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよー。
期待させんじゃねぇよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's yer issue. Stop
gettin' our hopes up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよー。
期待させんじゃねぇよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's yer issue. Stop
